                    <h1 class="padding-bottom--0 padding-top--0 margin-top--2 font-weight-700 margin-bottom--2 ">Population estimates for the UK, England, Wales, Scotland and Northern Ireland: mid-2024</h1>
                    <p class="page-bulletins--Summary margin-right-md--2 margin-bottom--3 padding-bottom--0 padding-top--0">
                    
                        
                            National and subnational mid-year population estimates for the UK and its constituent countries by age and sex.
                        
                    </p>
